  "prefLabel": "Phy 302.02 Commission on Accreditation in Physical Therapy Education (CAPTE)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 302.02 “Commission on Accreditation in Physical Therapy Education (CAPTE)” means the component of the American Physical Therapy Association that establishes the core requirements for physical therapy education and accredits programs of physical therapy education, or its successor.\n\nSource. #9233, eff 8-22-08; ss by #10933, eff 9-18-15; ss by #12864, eff 9-10-19; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36 (formerly Phy 302.03)",
